  "question": {
    "text": "A mass of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> is suspended by a rope of length <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>, from the ceiling. A force <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></math> is applied horizontally at the mid-point of the rope such that the top half of the rope makes an angle of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>45</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math> with the vertical. Then <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></math> equals: (Take <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> and the rope to be massless)",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "x0rXk",
      "text": "<math><mn>100</mn><mi></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "HTCeG",
      "text": "<math><mn>90</mn><mi></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "r0RMq",
      "text": "<math><mn>70</mn><mi></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "WEj2T",
      "text": "<math><mn>75</mn><mi></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let the tension in the string is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi></math>.</p><p>Applying the condition of equilibrium in the vertical&nbsp;direction,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>45</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mi>T</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>In the horizontal&nbsp;direction,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>45</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>F</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mi>T</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></math></p><p>Put&nbsp;the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi></math>&nbsp;from&nbsp;equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math>,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math></p><p>So, the horizontal force applied on the rope will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>100</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math>.</p>",
    "image": null
  },
